  "matrices-and-vectors.foot": "Every number is kept exact — fractions and square roots — and only angles are rounded. Two equations in two unknowns? <a href=\"{alg}\">The Balance Scale</a> solves them by elimination and substitution. Angles and the unit circle: <a href=\"{trig}\">the Unit Circle</a>. Quadratics and polynomials: <a href=\"{quad}\">the Area Box</a>.",

